<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xml:lang="zh-TW">
  <p>現在我們來讀一段社會科的短文。先聽一次，不用停下來查字。</p>
  <p><lang xml:lang="en-US">Fifty years ago, the air in our city was dirty. Factories produced smoke all day, and the pollution made many people ill.</lang></p>
  <p><lang xml:lang="en-US">The city government made a decision: it would reduce the number of old buses and make a large investment in clean transportation.</lang></p>
  <p><lang xml:lang="en-US">At first, many people disagreed. They thought the plan was impossible and the cost was unreasonable.</lang></p>
  <p><lang xml:lang="en-US">But the improvement was unexpected. Within ten years, the smoke had almost disappeared, and the city now exports electric buses to other countries.</lang></p>
  <p><lang xml:lang="en-US">Its story shows that the development of a city depends on the awareness of its people.</lang></p>
  <p><break time="2s"/>這段短文裡，畫底線的字都可以用你學過的零件拆開。我們一起看三個。</p>
  <p>disagreed：dis 是「相反」，agree 是同意，所以是不同意。<lang xml:lang="en-US">At first, many people disagreed.</lang> 一開始，很多人反對這個計畫。</p>
  <p>unreasonable：最外面是 un，裡面是 reasonable，「合理的」。<lang xml:lang="en-US">They thought the cost was unreasonable.</lang> 他們覺得花這麼多錢不合理。</p>
  <p>awareness：aware 加 ness，把「注意到、知道」這種狀態打包成名詞。<lang xml:lang="en-US">The development of a city depends on the awareness of its people.</lang> 城市能不能進步，要看大家有沒有意識到問題。</p>
  <p>剩下的字，換你自己拆。點一下畫底線的字，它會被帶到「採集」，原句也會一起帶過去。</p>
</speak>
